    ["　　“发生了什么事情？”克莱恩心头咯噔了一下。\n　　他害怕这个疯狂的“杂交学家”的实验出了问题，导致“未来号”众人陷入可怕的生态灾难里。\n　　弗兰克呆滞摇头道：\n　　“我不是给你说过那些小东西吗？\n　　“它们原本需要安眠一段时间才有可能生长和繁殖，结果……”\n　　“结果什么？”克莱恩的脸色已变得凝重。\n　　蹲着的弗兰克抬头上望道：\n　　“它们刚才完成了大规模的繁殖，还发生了异变。\n　　“这，这简直是神迹！”\n　　“然后呢？它们去了哪里？还在你的‘实验室’内吗？”克莱恩直觉地认为这不是好事。\n　　弗兰克用两秒钟的时间消化了问题，挽起袖子，露出体毛浓密的手臂。\n　　他敲了敲面前的甲板，露出疑惑的笑容道。\n　　“它们钻进了这里，好像在，在改造‘未来号’……”\n　　沉闷的敲击声中，甲板上突然涌出了一股疑似牛奶的乳白喷泉，溅了弗兰克·李满头满脸。\n　　他舔了嘴边的液体一口，惊喜出声道：\n　　“‘未来号’，‘未来号’产奶了！”\n\n　　——第三卷《旅行家》第一百七十四章 疯狂的异变"] = "“What happened?” Klein’s heart skipped a beat. \n He was afraid that this crazy “Hybridizer’s” experiment had gone wrong, causing the people on the Future to fall into a terrifying ecological disaster. \n Frank shook his head dully and said: \n “Didn’t I tell you about those little things? \n They originally needed to slumber for a period of time before they could grow and reproduce, but as a result…” \n “As a result of what?” Klein’s expression had become grave. \n Frank, who was squatting, looked up and said: \n “They just completed large-scale reproduction, and a mutation occurred. \n This, this is simply a miracle!” \n “Then what? Where did they go? Are they still in your ‘laboratory’?” Klein intuitively felt that this was not a good thing. \n Frank took two seconds to digest the question, rolled up his sleeves, and revealed his hairy arms. \n He knocked on the deck in front of him and said with a puzzled smile. \n “They drilled in here, it seems they are, they are modifying the Future…” \n Amidst the dull knocking sound, a milky white fountain suspected to be milk suddenly gushed out from the deck, splashing Frank Lee all over his head and face. \n He licked the liquid by his mouth and said in surprise: \n “The Future, the Future is producing milk!” \n \n —— Volume 3: Traveler, Chapter 174: Crazy Mutation",
